sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant I as Member institution
    participant TA as Trust account<br/>(settlement bank)
    participant AU as Reserve auditor
    participant MK as Maker
    participant CK as Checker
    participant RC as ReserveController
    participant T as TokenisedTaka

    I->>TA: sends taka by RTGS
    AU->>RC: publishReserveStatement(balance, document hash)
    MK->>RC: requestIssuance(institution, amount, RTGS reference)
    Note over RC: Each bank reference funds one issuance
    CK->>RC: approveIssuance(id)
    RC->>RC: checker is not the maker,<br/>statement is current,<br/>supply + amount within the reserve
    RC->>T: mint(settlement account, amount)
    Note over I,T: Redemption runs the other way: the institution sends tBDT,<br/>the checker confirms the taka payout, the controller burns
